  "StockRole": "Juggernaut & Ranged Assault",
  "YangsThoughts": "Touted as one of the most effective 'Mechs of all time, the Marauder saw wide usage by the SLDF before and during their Exodus from the Inner Sphere. During the years before their return, the Clans developed a followup to the venerable design, later dubbed the Marauder IIC, representing the pinnacle of Clan weapons technology prior to the advent of the OmniMech. Like other IIC designs, visual similarities between it and its predecessor initially led ComStar to incorrectly label the design as a mere refit of the original.",
